Subject: feat: add override hooks for 10 APIs (Batch 4)

Add window.customOverrides hooks for crypto.subtle.unwrapKey,
CSS.supports, CSSStyleDeclaration.getPropertyValue,
DynamicsCompressorNode (threshold/knee/ratio/attack/release),
and Element (getBoundingClientRect/getClientRects).

